            "Бархатцы", "Ma",
            "Хризантема", "Ch"
    ).map(Arrays::toString).map(Pattern::quote).toArray()) + ")", Pattern.CASE_INSENSITIVE);

    private static String getCategoryByKey(String flower) {
        Matcher matcher = FLOWER_PREFIX_PATTERN.matcher(flower);
        if (matcher.find()) {
            String prefix = matcher.group().toUpperCase();
            return Arrays.stream(new String[][] {
